<h2 local-id=3D"e479aa299eff" id=3D"BuiltInComplianceClassifications-BuiltI=
nComplianceClassifications(US)">Built In Compliance Classifications (US)</h=
2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1315" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"c2=
722866-bf5a-49ae-9250-605887faa910" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"06dda3e5621e">
<th data-local-id=3D"f1aea119631c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3036eff43bcb"><strong>Identifier name</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"965b228c0b01" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"665554704b92"><strong>Descriptions</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"055da944937a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"586a19229811"><strong>Regex</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f56f474d314a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"da4715fd1f4b"><strong>Notes</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"02562b97422f">
<th rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"7d48bbef8bd9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7d4450eee44e"><strong>Zip code (California)</strong></p></th=
>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"d5dfb5f1fb82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f959be4f443d">California Zip code matches a valid California=
 zip code combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of=
 10 terms: address, place of residence, postcode district, postcode area, p=
ostcode unit, postcode sector, postcode, Zip code, Zip (or) Postal code. (A=
ll terms case insensitive.)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0552f5db7b52" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0aed3954bf4">(9[0-5]\d{3}|96[0-5]\d{2})</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"4056273faec1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"476665c4f583">92335</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d33c7a16b1a3">
<th data-local-id=3D"bb84f530f6e4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3578aae8f4fa">(?i)(?:address|place of residence|postcode dis=
trict|postcode area|postcode unit|postcode sector|postcode|Zip code|Zip|Pos=
tal code)</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"15697085a001">
<th rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"5b079e0d-ce6d-41c3-b8e6-4f3f0f21eb6d" cl=
ass=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"79f31cbbab1d"><strong>Medicare number (US)</strong></p></th>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"053efd001dd9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8bd178275f77">US Medicare Number matches a valid medicare nu=
mber combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 t=
erms: MBI, Medicare Beneficiary Identifier, Medicare ID, Medicare number, M=
edicare card number, Medicare policy number (or) Medicare claim number. (Al=
l terms case insensitive.)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2b3a23dd-6932-4d29-a241-8821f86ff5a9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1501a132383e">([1-9][AC-HJ-NP-RT-aVWXY][0-9AC-HJ-NP-RT-VWXY]=
[0-9](?:[-\s]?)[AC-HJ-NP-RT-VWXY][0-9AC-HJ-NP-RT-VWXY][0-9](?:[-\s]?)[AC-HJ=
-NP-RT-VWXY]{2}\d{2})</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"2e8cefad68ac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5af4e00f48e8">1EG4-TE5-MK73</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d324a2a3d885">
<th data-local-id=3D"ca86b1b72d28" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0cb51ff2e089">(?i)(?:MBI|Medicare Beneficiary Identifier|Med=
icare ID|Medicare number|Medicare card number|Medicare policy number|Medica=
re claim number)</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"416ececd0f83">
<th rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"af205f64-b05e-43b4-b738-d98bab8be302" cl=
ass=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"96c7304f5490"><strong>Medicaid number (US)</strong></p></th>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"9a1b287b3242" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2350c5f6c0ae">US Medicaid Number matches a valid medicaid nu=
mber combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 t=
erms: Medicaid ID, Medicaid number, Medicaid recipient ID, Recipient ID, Me=
dicaid beneficiary number, Medicaid member ID, Medicaid card number (or) Me=
dicaid policy number. (All terms case insensitive.)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cf023b36-0038-400a-ad12-f07fbf3eaf79" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"deb868ba874f">(?:(?:10|11)\d{7}|[A-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]\d{7}[A=
-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]|[A-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]{2}\d{10}|[A-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]{2}=
\d{5}[A-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]|[A-HJ-NP-Z]{2}\d{9}|\d{8,9}[A-CE-HJ-NP-RT-VWXYZ]=
|\d{7,13})</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"14f20fc70cd9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3bb29b9f062">12345678A or AB12345C<br></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5b0f3c04107b">
<th data-local-id=3D"48e00320ddbe" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7a6debbe7555">(?i)(?:Medicaid ID|Medicaid number|Medicaid re=
cipient ID|Recipient ID|Medicaid beneficiary number|Medicaid member ID|Medi=
caid card number|Medicaid policy number)</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"968a599c7fbd">
<th rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"ca50237b0827" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4fc928193ec9"><strong>North American Electric Reliability Co=
rporation (NERC)</strong></p></th>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"2978edeae897" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"974be0339df1">US North American Electric Reliability Corpora=
tion - NERC (US) matches a valid North American electric reliability corpor=
ation code matches with any of the following keywords CIP, Critical Infrast=
ructure and a code combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: North American Electric Reliability Corporation, NERC, =
Vulnerability and Risk Assessment, Security Management Controls, Personnel =
&amp; Training, Electronic Security Perimeters, Physical Security, System S=
ecurity, Incident Reporting, Response Planning, Vulnerability Assessment, S=
upply Chain Risk Management, Information Protection, Change Management, Rec=
overy Plans for BES Cyber Systems, NERC security, NERC security guidelines,=
 CIP Security, CIP Security Guidelines, NERC cyber security, NERC cyber sec=
urity guidelines, NERC physical security, NERC physical security guidelines=
, NERC supply chain, NERC supply chain guidelines, Electricity sector secur=
ity, Electricity sector security guidelines, Bulk electric system security,=
 Bulk electric system security guidelines, Bulk Electric System (or) BES.</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dd37625-82c3-43fb-907a-c51c96c84580" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46d0304d2edb">(?i)((CIP|Critical Infrastructure Protection)-=
(00[2-9]|0[1-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2})(-\d{1,2}[a-z]?)?)</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"53581212d5e6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e28be67fe41"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c5241cbc6ddb">
<th data-local-id=3D"383a6d3fdf42" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fcd8c351dac8">(?i)(?:North American Electric Reliability Cor=
poration|NERC|Vulnerability and Risk Assessment|Security Management Control=
s|Personnel &amp; Training|Electronic Security Perimeters|Physical Security=
|System Security|Incident Reporting|Response Planning|Vulnerability Assessm=
ent|Supply Chain Risk Management|Information Protection|Change Management|R=
ecovery Plans for BES Cyber Systems|NERC security( guidelines?)?|CIP Securi=
ty( Guidelines?)?|NERC cyber security( guidelines?)?|NERC physical security=
( guidelines?)?|NERC supply chain( guidelines?)?|Electricity sector securit=
y( guidelines?)?|Bulk electric system security( guidelines?)?|Bulk Electric=
 System|BES)</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"34a693845ca9">
<th data-local-id=3D"8631de09bccb" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fda4d9c6a5eb"><strong>US Intelligence Control Markings (CAPC=
O) &amp; DCID 1/7</strong></p></th>
<td data-local-id=3D"58e3609dbddd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e52f88ed062c">US Intelligence Control Markings (CAPCO) &amp;=
 DCID 1/7 correspond to any of the following formats: Classification only, =
Classification + SCI, Classification + Dissemination, or Classification + S=
CI + Dissemination. For example: TOP SECRET//SI//TK//NOFORN.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c5497006-be80-4c6e-b73f-5f69c4046274" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd627477f288">((?:TOP SECRET|SECRET|CONFIDENTIAL|UNCLASSIFIE=
D|TS|[USC](?=3D\/\/(?:SI|TK|HCS|GAMMA|GCK|SAP|SCI|FISA|IMC|NOFORN|NF|RELIDO=
|ORCON|OC|PROPIN|PR|IMCON|RSEN|DISPLAY ONLY|CUI|FOUO|LIMDIS|EXDIS|NODIS|EYE=
S ONLY|WNINTEL|NSI|FVEY|NATO|REL TO(?: [A-Z, ]+)?)))(?:(?:\/\/(?:SI|TK|HCS|=
GAMMA|GCK|SAP|SCI|FISA|IMC))+)?(?:(?:\/\/(?:NOFORN|NF|RELIDO|ORCON|OC|PROPI=
N|PR|IMCON|RSEN|DISPLAY ONLY|CUI|FOUO|LIMDIS|EXDIS|NODIS|EYES ONLY|WNINTEL|=
NSI|FVEY|NATO|REL TO(?: [A-Z, ]+)?))+)?)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c94cc73f8221" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b30b726b0cb8">Examples :<br>
TOP SECRET<br>
TOP SECRET//SI<br>
TOP SECRET//SI//TK<br>
TOP SECRET//SI//TK//NOFORN<br>
TOP SECRET//NOFORN<br>
TOP SECRET//SI//TK//HCS//GAMMA//NOFORN</p>
<p local-id=3D"61e80e884652"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"83c99f4ded43">
<th rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"ebffce86e142" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"68b0f90a5fc8"><strong>Swift Code</strong></p></th>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"fb4f35f517cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a7593c61ae9"></p></td>
<th data-local-id=3D"6c5b158bba5f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7f378aef6ad4">[A-Z]{4}[A-Z]{2}[A-Z0-9]{2}([A-Z0-9]{3})?</p><=
/th>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"9d4a96191209" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d5491fcc73d">Already exists</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6908d348d7ff">
<th data-local-id=3D"f6c3a60b6b81" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8f34e0e2c4f7">(?i)(?:Swift code|International Routing Number=
|bank association routing number|bank routing|routing no|routing|Bank Ident=
ification Number|BIC|RTN|SWIFT Address|Sort Code|Swift)</p></th>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"4dc62064726a" id=3D"BuiltInComplianceClassifications-Russia=
nFederalLawonPersonalData(No.152-FZ)">Russian Federal Law on Personal Data =
(No. 152-FZ)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"30d956546928"><strong>Russia</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1315" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"03=
529165-bcd7-487a-8a33-f3a259259d9f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b6ce8bace240">
<th data-local-id=3D"2d273095-cb79-45bf-8dbf-0f79d0a2c585" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0eb69ffc8796"><strong>Identifier name</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"40b578c5-4308-4426-9f58-2b34bd387713" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3ce9fc506e8e"><strong>Descriptions</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"42352d17-e8e5-4c44-b756-0c181aa09a1d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ac78101525ab"><strong>Regex</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e7c8e6e5-ebee-4788-bcdf-4d2fcd6ef346" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0ece2db79ce5"><strong>Notes</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"77c49c544f7d">
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"09b89c09-c7d0-4390-ab56-9352de9c1e00" cl=
ass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"902036fdee1c"><strong>Email</strong></p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"12de2ac70edb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"562cb9e36486"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1ab87ded-d919-4ab3-8810-d8655e2cfeef" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"214d6504958b">(?i)[A-Z0-9._%+-]{1,64}\@[A-Z0-9.-]{1,63}\.((?=
:[A-Z]{1,63})|=D1=80=D1=84)</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"657ab2fe062a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44ada5ee2b97"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b69f9a22413e">
<td data-local-id=3D"8c8d5f010c20" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6af22e670dd5"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"246e265cf8c2">
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"69df4210-8524-4dec-9a8c-21f66e70086e" cl=
ass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94e10681c1b4"><strong>Bank account number</strong></p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"b0de5ad83687" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bee5a4a9a61d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e0f863de-6137-4b22-be5c-95e27bea167f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f93219e9542">(\d{5}\s?\d{5}\s?\d{5}\s?\d{5})</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"f1c736a4841e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f67744ab5b37"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"605f464e81f1">
<td data-local-id=3D"a1bd10ce08e4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a3aa7c9d4fb9"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0047ea89503e">
<td data-local-id=3D"71bdeec9-bddf-4353-992e-a3e428ce6701" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
